      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A 226‑foot‑wide neon billboard was erected on the hillside in the 1930s, later painted by Alcoa in 1967 to spell 'PITTSBURGH' in mosaic font.",
